WEBVTT


00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:02.580
And I heard that you like reading fantasy books?

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:03.166
I do

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.060
What's your favourite fantasy book?

00:00:04.061 --> 00:00:05.020
I mean, Lord of the rings,

00:00:05.021 --> 00:00:06.440
The Silmarillion, anything

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.580
J R R Tolkien, incredible

00:00:09.581 --> 00:00:11.460
Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep

00:00:11.461 --> 00:00:14.120
Philip K. Dick. Incredible
